        "2": {
            "ID": "1888017",
            "URL": "https://thetvdb.com/series/the-demonic-king-who-chases-his-wife/seasons/official/2",
            "Titles": {
                "eng": "One Life Allure",
                "jpn": null,
                "zho": "一世倾城 (Yishi Qingcheng)"
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "Miss Chai Su Luo received a different look from Jin Wang's Nangong Liuyun, and determined that she was a dual type of wood and fire, and she also possessed the extinct spatial power of this stretch of road. Nangong was seriously injured to save Su Luo and fell into a desperate situation of soul disorder. In order to return the favor, Su Luo asked the master alchemist Rong Yun to treat Nangong Liuyun, and the two also decided to grow together through Rong Yun's guidance. Su Luo discovered that Rong Yun was not only a master alchemist but also a master of space, so he made up his mind to worship Rong Yun as a teacher. It is precisely because of this incident that Su Luo found that his life experience became a fan...",
                "jpn": null,
                "zho": "废柴小姐苏落得到晋王南宫流云的另眼相看，测定她是木火双系，并且还拥有这片大路上绝迹的空间力量。南宫为救苏落身受重伤，陷入灵魂紊乱的绝命境地。苏落为还人情，找来炼药大师容云救治南宫流云，两人也经容云指点，决定携手共同成长。苏落发现容云不仅是炼药大师还是空间法师，便下定决心要拜容云为师。也正是因为此事苏落发现自己身世成迷……"
            },
